## Phase 5.1: Shader libraries and PSO cache
Docs: [Shader System](../planning/subsystems/shader-system.md), [Pipeline State](../planning/subsystems/pipeline-state.md)
- [ ] Implement shader library persistence and rehydration.
- [ ] Implement offline/serialized PSO cache artifacts.
- [ ] Validate cache invalidation on backend/compiler/driver changes.

## Phase 5.2: Advanced binding features
Docs: [Descriptors and Binding](../planning/subsystems/descriptors-and-binding.md)
- [ ] Implement bindless resources when capability-gated.
- [ ] Expand descriptor update batching and pooling policies.

## Phase 5.3: Multithreaded recording and RHI thread
Docs: [Command Model](../planning/subsystems/command-model.md)
- [ ] Enable task-based parallel recording at scale.
- [ ] Integrate optional dedicated RHI thread configuration.
- [ ] Validate thread-safety in command allocators and submission.

## Phase 5.4: Additional backends
Docs: [Driver Backends](../planning/subsystems/driver-backends.md)
- [ ] Bring up a second backend (Vulkan or D3D12) using the same RHI contracts.
- [ ] Validate capability gating and fallback behavior across backends.

## Phase 5.5: Diagnostics and profiling
Docs: [Diagnostics and Tooling](../planning/subsystems/diagnostics-and-tooling.md)
- [ ] Expand GPU profiling counters and memory stats.
- [ ] Harden GPU crash capture and reporting workflows.
- [ ] Validate diagnostics overhead and gating.

## Phase 5.6: Compute pipeline and dispatch
Docs: [Pipeline State](../planning/subsystems/pipeline-state.md), [Command Model](../planning/subsystems/command-model.md), [Resource State Model](../planning/subsystems/resource-state-model.md)
- [ ] Implement compute PSO creation, hashing, and caching.
- [ ] Add compute dispatch commands and binding validation.
- [ ] Gate async compute usage via driver capabilities.

## Phase 5.7: Memory budgets and residency reporting
Docs: [Resource System](../planning/subsystems/resource-system.md), [Diagnostics and Tooling](../planning/subsystems/diagnostics-and-tooling.md)
- [ ] Implement backend memory budget and residency reporting.
- [ ] Surface allocation failures and eviction telemetry in diagnostics.
